Narration: Lily was alone in her room.
Narration: Her mother had left early that morning.
Lily: Maybe I should play for a while.
[signal arg="play_inside_tower"]
label done_playing
Lily: The view outside is so beautiful...
Lily: If only I could go outside with Mother.
Layla: Lily! Hii! Do you still remember me?
Lily: Layla? Is that you?
Layla: That's right! You remember me!
Lily: What are you doing here again?
Layla: I came to invite you to play!
Layla: Don't you get bored staying inside the tower?
Layla: There's a Moon Festival in the village tonight!
Layla: There'll be lots of food and games!
Lily: Um...
Layla: We'll come back before your mother does!
Lily: ..Alright
[signal arg="festival_games"]